褚先生曰：丈夫龍變。傳曰：「蛇化為龍，不變其文；家化為國，不變其姓。」丈夫當時富貴，百惡滅除，光耀榮華，貧賤之時何足累之哉！","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m038-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"褚先生","kind":"person","person_id":"nq4_rjk_iab","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi","book_id":"b-shiji-049","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-049-waiqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p041","text":"褚先生曰：浴不必江海，要之去垢；馬不必騏驥，要之善走；士不必賢世，要之知道；女不必貴種，要之貞好。傳曰：「女無美惡，入室見妒；士無賢不肖，入朝見嫉。」美女者，惡女之仇。豈不然哉！","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m041-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"褚先生","kind":"person","person_id":"nq4_rjk_iab","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi","book_id":"b-shiji-049","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-049-waiqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:p023","text":"褚先生曰：臣為郎時，聞之於宮殿中老郎吏好事者稱道之也。竊以為令梁孝王怨望，欲為不善者，事從中生。今太后，女主也，以愛少子故，欲令梁王為太子。大臣不時正言其不可狀，阿意治小，私說意以受賞賜，非忠臣也。齊如魏其侯竇嬰之正言也，何以有後禍？景帝與王燕見，侍太后飲，景帝曰：「千秋萬歲之後傳王。」太后喜說。竇嬰在前，據地言曰：「漢法之約，傳子適孫，今帝何以得傳弟，擅亂高帝約乎！」於是景帝默然無聲。太后意不說。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m023-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"褚先生","kind":"person","person_id":"nq4_rjk_iab","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m023-0016","start":16,"end":19,"surface":"老郎吏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、制度泛稱、所舉古事或未定指代；不補來源未見姓名、成員及關係。"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m023-0031","start":31,"end":34,"surface":"梁孝王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACG","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m023-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"ixk_6fg_v6f_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m023-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"梁王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACG","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m023-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"太子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、制度泛稱、所舉古事或未定指代；不補來源未見姓名、成員及關係。"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m023-0101","start":101,"end":106,"surface":"魏其侯竇嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"nuf_tb9_fjs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m023-0117","start":117,"end":119,"surface":"景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m023-0125","start":125,"end":127,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"ixk_6fg_v6f_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m023-0129","start":129,"end":131,"surface":"景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m023-0144","start":144,"end":146,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"ixk_6fg_v6f_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m023-0149","start":149,"end":151,"surface":"竇嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"nuf_tb9_fjs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m023-0166","start":166,"end":169,"surface":"子適孫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、制度泛稱、所舉古事或未定指代；不補來源未見姓名、成員及關係。"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m023-0171","start":171,"end":172,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m023-0180","start":180,"end":182,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m023-0188","start":188,"end":190,"surface":"景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m023-0195","start":195,"end":197,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"ixk_6fg_v6f_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-058-liang","book_id":"b-shiji-058","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-058-liang"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:p018","text":"褚先生曰：臣幸得以文學為侍郎，好覽觀太史公之列傳。傳中稱三王世家文辭可觀，求其世家終不能得。竊從長老好故事者取其封策書，編列其事而傳之，令後世得觀賢主之指意。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m018-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"褚先生","kind":"person","person_id":"nq4_rjk_iab","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m018-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m018-0048","start":48,"end":54,"surface":"長老好故事者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、制度泛稱、祖先或未定指代；不補未見姓名、成員或確定親屬。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang","book_id":"b-shiji-060","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-060-sanwang"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:p010","text":"褚先生曰：臣為郎時，聞之曰田仁故與任安相善。任安，滎陽人也。少孤貧困，為人將車之長安，留，求事為小吏，未有因緣也，因占著名數。武功，扶風西界小邑也，谷口蜀道近山。安以為武功小邑，無豪，易高也，安留，代人為求盜亭父。後為亭長。邑中人民俱出獵，任安常為人分麋鹿雉兔，部署老小當壯劇易處，眾人皆喜，曰：「無傷也，任少卿分別平，有智略。」明日復合會，會者數百人。任少卿曰：「某子甲何為不來乎？」諸人皆怪其見之疾也。其後除為三老，舉為親民，出為三百石長，治民。坐上行出游共帳不辦，斥免。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m010-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"褚先生","kind":"person","person_id":"nq4_rjk_iab","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m010-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"田仁","kind":"person","person_id":"6bn_yfc_lzi_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m010-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"任安","kind":"person","person_id":"y9g_gi6_sn7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m010-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"任安","kind":"person","person_id":"y9g_gi6_sn7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m010-0081","start":81,"end":82,"surface":"安","kind":"person","person_id":"y9g_gi6_sn7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m010-0096","start":96,"end":97,"surface":"安","kind":"person","person_id":"y9g_gi6_sn7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m010-0120","start":120,"end":122,"surface":"任安","kind":"person","person_id":"y9g_gi6_sn7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m010-0153","start":153,"end":156,"surface":"任少卿","kind":"person","person_id":"y9g_gi6_sn7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m010-0177","start":177,"end":180,"surface":"任少卿","kind":"person","person_id":"y9g_gi6_sn7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m010-0183","start":183,"end":186,"surface":"某子甲","kind":"person","person_id":"8jr_zbk_lao","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu","book_id":"b-shiji-104","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-104-tianshu"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:p013","text":"褚先生曰：臣幸得以經術為郎，而好讀外家傳語。竊不遜讓，復作故事滑稽之語六章，編之於左。可以覽觀揚意，以示後世好事者讀之，以游心駭耳，以附益上方太史公之三章。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m013-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"褚先生","kind":"person","person_id":"nq4_rjk_iab","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m013-0071","start":71,"end":74,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji","book_id":"b-shiji-126","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji126-huaji"},{"id":"c-shiji-127-rizhe:p020","text":"褚先生曰：臣爲郎時，游觀長安中，見卜筮之賢大夫，觀其起居行歩，坐起自動，誓正其衣冠而當鄕人也，有君子之風。見性好解婦來卜，對之顏色嚴振，未嘗見齒而笑也。從古以來，賢者避世，有居止舞澤者，有居民閒閉口不言，有隱居卜筮閒以全身者。夫司馬季主者，楚賢大夫，游學長安，通易經，術黃帝、老子，博聞遠見。觀其對二大夫貴人之談言，稱引古明王聖人道，固非淺聞小數之能。及卜筮立名聲千里者，各往往而在。傳曰：「富爲上，貴次之；既貴各各學一伎能立其身。」黃直，大夫也；陳君夫，婦人也：以相馬立名天下。齊張仲、曲成侯以善擊刺學用劍，立名天下。留長孺以相彘立名。滎陽褚氏以相牛立名。能以伎能立名者甚多，皆有高世絶人之風，何可勝言。故曰：「非其地，樹之不生；非其意，教之不成。」夫家之教子孫，當視其所以好，好含茍生活之道，因而成之。故曰：「制宅命子，足以觀士；子有處所，可謂賢人。」臣爲郎時，與太卜待詔爲郎者同署，言曰：「孝武帝時，聚會占家問之，某日可取婦乎？五行家曰可，堪輿家曰不可，建除家曰不吉，叢辰家曰大凶，歷家曰小凶，天人家曰小吉，太一家曰大吉。辯訟不決，以狀聞。制曰：『避諸死忌，以五行爲主。』」人取於五行者也。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-127-rizhe:m020-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"褚先生","kind":"person","person_id":"nq4_rjk_iab","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-127-rizhe:m020-0017","start":17,"end":23,"surface":"卜筮之賢大夫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-127-rizhe:m020-0114","start":114,"end":118,"surface":"司馬季主","kind":"person","person_id":"r8r_74l_t6d","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-127-rizhe:m020-0135","start":135,"end":137,"surface":"黃帝","kind":"person","person_id":"xpw_io6_vl8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-127-rizhe:m020-0138","start":138,"end":140,"surface":"老子","kind":"person","person_id":"881_5eh_yg3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-127-rizhe:m020-0149","start":149,"end":152,"surface":"二大夫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-127-rizhe:m020-0217","start":217,"end":219,"surface":"黃直","kind":"person","person_id":"m07_sq1_i5d","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-127-rizhe:m020-0224","start":224,"end":227,"surface":"陳君夫","kind":"person","person_id":"n57_5uq_1po","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-127-rizhe:m020-0240","start":240,"end":243,"surface":"齊張仲","kind":"person","person_id":"vjn_9tq_v8g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-127-rizhe:m020-0244","start":244,"end":247,"surface":"曲成侯","kind":"person","person_id":"44e_ha1_oe8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-127-rizhe:m020-0260","start":260,"end":263,"surface":"留長孺","kind":"person","person_id":"w41_czk_7u6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-127-rizhe:m020-0269","start":269,"end":273,"surface":"滎陽褚氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-127-rizhe:m020-0384","start":384,"end":391,"surface":"太卜待詔爲郎者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-127-rizhe:m020-0398","start":398,"end":401,"surface":"孝武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"jbn_p40_9ph","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-127-rizhe","book_id":"b-shiji-127","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji127-rizhe"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:p006","text":"褚先生曰：臣以通經術，受業博士，治春秋，以高第為郎，幸得宿衛，出入宮殿中十有餘年。竊好太史公傳。太史公之傳曰：「三王不同龜，四夷各異卜，然各以決吉凶，略闚其要，故作龜策列傳。」臣往來長安中，求龜策列傳不能得，故之大卜官，問掌故文學長老習事者，寫取龜策卜事，編于下方。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m006-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"褚先生","kind":"person","person_id":"nq4_rjk_iab","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m006-0043","start":43,"end":46,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m006-0048","start":48,"end":51,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m006-0111","start":111,"end":120,"surface":"掌故文學長老習事者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-128-guice","book_id":"b-shiji-128","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji128-guice"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:p021","text":"褚先生曰：漁者舉網而得神龜，龜自見夢宋元王，元王召博士衛平告以夢龜狀，平運式，定日月，分衡度，視吉凶，占龜與物色同，平諫王留神龜以為國重寶，美矣。古者筮必稱龜者，以其令名，所從來久矣。余述而為傳。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m021-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"褚先生","kind":"person","person_id":"nq4_rjk_iab","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m021-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"神龜","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m021-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"宋元王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m021-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"元王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m021-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"衛平","kind":"person","person_id":"p27_7v5_rgy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m021-0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"平","kind":"person","person_id":"p27_7v5_rgy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m021-0058","start":58,"end":59,"surface":"平","kind":"person","person_id":"p27_7v5_rgy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m021-0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"神龜","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-128-guice","book_id":"b-shiji-128","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji128-guice"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-048","source_id":"s-shiji-048-chenshe","source":{"title":"史記／卷048","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷048","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷048&oldid=2531218","revision_id":2531218,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"26段史文；前20段篇文，後6段明署褚先生曰及所引賈生文字另分層，排除註釋版導覽與2個dd。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"editorial_readings":[],"extraction_note":"取得時HTML與固定修訂一致，只去除段落外緣空白；保留间、铚、余及熒一作「滎」陽等原字。第10段一作是數位校勘字樣，不當古文，未擅選讀法。","note":"已讀全26段並作明示人名首輪，褚氏與所引賈氏未補姓名；未核底本、影像或現代研究。"}}},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-049","source_id":"s-shiji-049-waiqi","source":{"title":"史記／卷049","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷049","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷049&oldid=7903610","revision_id":7903610,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"44段史文，前34段篇文，後10段自褚先生曰起為附載文字；數位分節欄題不是古文段落。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa